      },
      "text": "A camera lens is a **spatial Fourier filter** applied to scene light before it reaches the recording medium. Everything that degrades image quality — blur, aberrations, diffraction — can be understood as unwanted modification of the spatial frequency spectrum."
    },
    {
      "id": "01-OPTICS-LENSES.md#003",
