        "title": "Optics and Lenses",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "The lens does four things:\n  1. COLLECT light — aperture determines how much\n  2. FOCUS light — focal length determines where the plane of sharp focus is\n  3. SCALE the image — focal length × magnification = image size\n  4. FILTER spatially — aberrations reduce contrast at high spatial frequencies"
    },
    {
      "id": "01-OPTICS-LENSES.md#005",
      "path": [
        "01-OPTICS-LENSES.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
