        "section": "photography",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Optics and Lenses",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Key tension: larger aperture → more light + shallower DoF + more aberrations\n             smaller aperture → less light + deeper DoF + diffraction softening\n```"
    },
